{"id":"622461","name":"黑芝麻椒盐南瓜花卷","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/622461/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"南瓜泥","amount":"适量"},{"name":"发酵粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"花椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黑芝麻","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香葱碎","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"适量南瓜泥晾至温热。","img":"images/622461/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"适量发酵粉。","img":"images/622461/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅匀。","img":"images/622461/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入面粉中。","img":"images/622461/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅成絮状。","img":"images/622461/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"和成软硬适中的面团，放温暖处发酵。","img":"images/622461/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"面粉，花椒粉倒入适量玉米油和成花椒油酥。","img":"images/622461/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"芝麻盐。","img":"images/622461/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"香葱碎。","img":"images/622461/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"发好的南瓜面团。","img":"images/622461/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"取适量面团，排气揉圆。","img":"images/622461/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"擀开。","img":"images/622461/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"擀成薄片。","img":"images/622461/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"撒上薄薄的一层盐。","img":"images/622461/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"抹上椒盐油酥。","img":"images/622461/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"撒上黑芝麻和香葱。","img":"images/622461/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"从下往上卷起。","img":"images/622461/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"用刀切成均匀的小剂孑。","img":"images/622461/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"取两个小剂子叠放在一起。","img":"images/622461/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"用筷子从中间压成花卷。","img":"images/622461/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"做好的花卷饧发20分钟。","img":"images/622461/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"饧发好的花卷冷水上屉，中火蒸20分钟。","img":"images/622461/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"蒸好的黑芝麻椒盐南瓜花卷。","img":"images/622461/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/622461/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/622461/step_25.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}